title: "Research Repository Template"
abstract: "A reusable GitHub repository template for reproducible empirical and structural research, separating task-organized source code, raw and derived data, research documentation, and mirrored outputs, with built-in rules for Dropbox/Overleaf workflows and AI coding agents. Author website: https://phuongmho.github.io/"
